{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1248969-backer-kit","id":1248969,"title":"Backer kit","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-26T09:45:39-07:00","id":1248969,"title":"Backer kit","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> Sorry if these questions have been answered before (just point me there and I will be on my merry way):<br /> <br /> <br /> 1. I want to buy the second edition book: What is the difference between Kickstarter and BackerKit? I have never used any of those pages and I have no idea why there is 2 of them for the book.<br /> 2. Does the book (or any forum thread, development post, etc) deal with things that were made in between editions? Like the Direction Courts in Dark Eras? (I really like the Contracts, but those are not Royal nor Common)<br /> <br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 08-26-2018, 01:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-26T10:01:57-07:00","id":1248970,"title":"","content":"I cannot answer your first question sadly as I'm not sure what the difference is but the pdf you get through the kickstarter is the final book and if anything is updated you'll get access to the updated book. As to your second question the directional courts were made while changeling was being written and with 2e in mind. I have not looked at the dar era book myself but I do doubt that they'd be much different from the final 2e result. If anything was off (after referencing court creation rules) you could tweak what was printed in dark eras to more closely line up with 2e","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-26T11:58:01-07:00","id":1248985,"title":"","content":"Backerkit is basically a way to manage crowdfunders like Kickstarters.<br /> <br /> How Onyx Path do them is like this: they run a Kickstarter for a month, then that's it, no more Kickstarter. Sometime later - at least a month, if not longer - they'll open the Backerkit, allowing KS backers to change their pledge, or add additional things to the pledge, and allowing people who missed the KS to preorder stuff from it. Eventually, before the Kickstarted book goes on sale to the public, they'll close the Backerkit as well.<br /> <br /> So the reason there are two pages is because the Backerkit is there for those who missed the Kickstarter. The pre-order link on the Kickstarter page goes to the Backerkit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-26T17:12:38-07:00","id":1249037,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1248969-backer-kit#post1248969\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2. Does the book (or any forum thread, development post, etc) deal with things that were made in between editions? Like the Direction Courts in Dark Eras? (I really like the Contracts, but those are not Royal nor Common)</div> </div> </div> </div>The 2e core book doesn't cover these in that much detail, but the KS funded supplements include one that I believe is going to cover these concerns. So you're not going to have new Court Contracts for non-Seasonal Courts in the core book, but it should be in one of the first supplements for 2e.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1248969-backer-kit?p=1248985#post1248985\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So the reason there are two pages is because the Backerkit is there for those who missed the Kickstarter. The pre-order link on the Kickstarter page goes to the Backerkit.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just to add a bit here:<br /> <br /> Backerkit isn't part of Kickstarter. Backerkit is a third party company that offers a number of services for creators that use Kickstarter and Indiegogo (and I'm sure they want to expand to others) to help handle fulfillment. So one of the reasons there's two pages, is it's two different companies: Kickstarter page for the crowdfunding, Backerkit for the post-funding fulfillment service.<br /> <br /> One of Backerkit's services is to help when people pledge incorrect values for what they want, or missed the Kickstarter, by having a store that can be used to add things you forgot to pledge for, or use as a pre-order shop.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}